{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Chat deletion — revised D-067\n\nCancel and settle active work, then delete chat data.\nKeep completed repository edits.\n\n[[Run Lifecycle Design]]\n[[Container & Settings Rules]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "delete",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · User requests Delete\n\nDeleting a chat keeps existing repository files, including its latest completed edits.\nActive work is cancelled before cleanup.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "block",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · Mark deleting\n\nCapture any active run.\nBlock new prompts, tools, approvals, moves and retrieval.\nNo late completion can revive the chat.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "active",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3 · Any active work?\n\nCheck actual run/process state.\nActive runs need cancellation/settlement.\nIdle or never-started work needs no file rollback.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "stop",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · Cancel and settle\n\nCancel generation, retries and approvals.\nSettle owned writers safely.\nRetain this project’s reservation during cleanup.\nNo model-written farewell needed.",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · Preserve actual edits\n\nKeep current repository files.\nResolve genuinely unknown effects.\nNo automatic rollback or undo journal.\nKnown retained edits do not pause deletion.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "cleanup",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · Delete chat data\n\nAfter safe cancellation/settlement, remove transcript, provider state and chat-owned derived data.\nApply source/memory cleanup.",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "done",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 7 · Chat removed\n\nDiscard late callbacks and memory writes.\nDo not recreate chat records.\nRelease scheduling after cleanup settles.",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "no_restore",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## No active work\n\nCancel a never-started queue entry if present.\nKeep repository changes.\nProceed to chat-owned data cleanup.",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cleanup needs attention\n\nA process/action outcome is genuinely unknown.\nRetain necessary reconciliation records.\nKnown retained edits alone do not block deletion.",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "earlier",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Preserve earlier work\n\nEarlier finished/failed-run edits remain.\nDo not remove the project or repo folder.\nThe chat’s permanent project binding does not prohibit deleting the chat.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "approval",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Cancel pending permissions\n\nLate approval clicks cannot run the deleted chat’s action.\nDo not start another model request to finish or summarize a deleting chat.",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## D-029 memory boundary\n\nDelete this source and its references.\nKeep other chats and facts supported elsewhere.\nInvalidate unsupported managed memory/caches.\n[[Memory & Context Policy]]",
      "x": 2500,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Container deletion differs\n\nDeleting a chat keeps code.\nDeleting a physical project/section/agent folder deletes code inside it.\nExternal linked folders survive.\nD-059 / D-067.",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
